{{also|Hypothalamus}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{prefix|hypo|thalamus|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|hypothalami}}

# {{label|en|anatomy}} A region of the [[forebrain]] located below the [[thalamus]], forming the basal portion of the [[diencephalon]], and functioning to regulate body temperature, some metabolic processes and governing the [[autonomic nervous system]].

====Derived terms====
* [[hypothalamic]]

